# MyAgent 测试工作流规约

## 核心原则

**❌ 禁止行为**：
- ❌ 不得要求用户手动测试
- ❌ 不得让用户在浏览器中验证
- ❌ 不得跳过自动化验证步骤
- ❌ 不得说"部署后请测试"

**✅ 必须行为**：
- ✅ 所有验证必须由 Claude 自动完成
- ✅ 自动重启服务并验证启动状态
- ✅ 自动构建真实 HTTP 请求进行测试
- ✅ 自动检查日志输出和响应结果
- ✅ 验证失败时自动调试并修复

## 1. 端口管理规约

### 1.1 固定端口配置

```typescript
// 后端服务端口
const BACKEND_PORT = 3000;

// 前端服务端口
const FRONTEND_PORT = 5173;
```

### 1.2 进程终止策略

**根据端口号查找并终止进程**：

```bash
# 查找占用端口的进程 PID
lsof -ti :3000    # 后端
lsof -ti :5173    # 前端

# 终止进程
kill -9 $(lsof -ti :3000)    # 强制终止后端
kill -9 $(lsof -ti :5173)    # 强制终止前端

# 或者使用更安全的方式
kill $(lsof -ti :3000)       # 优雅终止后端
kill $(lsof -ti :5173)       # 优雅终止前端
```

**完整脚本**：
```bash
# 终止后端进程
if lsof -ti :3000 > /dev/null 2>&1; then
  echo "Terminating backend process on port 3000..."
  kill -9 $(lsof -ti :3000)
  sleep 2
  echo "Backend process terminated"
fi

# 终止前端进程
if lsof -ti :5173 > /dev/null 2>&1; then
  echo "Terminating frontend process on port 5173..."
  kill -9 $(lsof -ti :5173)
  sleep 2
  echo "Frontend process terminated"
fi
```

## 2. 服务启动流程

### 2.1 后端服务启动

**步骤**：
1. 检查并终止旧进程（端口 3000）
2. 启动后端服务
3. 验证启动状态
4. 检查日志输出

**实现**：
```bash
# 1. 终止旧进程
echo "Step 1: Cleaning up old backend process..."
if lsof -ti :3000 > /dev/null 2>&1; then
  kill -9 $(lsof -ti :3000) 2>/dev/null
  sleep 2
fi

# 2. 启动后端服务（后台运行）
echo "Step 2: Starting backend service..."
npm run dev > /tmp/myagent-backend.log 2>&1 &
BACKEND_PID=$!

# 3. 等待服务启动
echo "Step 3: Waiting for backend to start..."
sleep 10  # 给服务足够的启动时间

# 4. 验证服务状态
echo "Step 4: Verifying backend status..."
if lsof -ti :3000 > /dev/null 2>&1; then
  echo "✅ Backend started successfully on port 3000"
  echo "Backend PID: $(lsof -ti :3000)"
else
  echo "❌ Backend failed to start"
  echo "Backend logs:"
  tail -50 /tmp/myagent-backend.log
  exit 1
fi

# 5. 检查健康端点
echo "Step 5: Checking health endpoint..."
sleep 3
if curl -s http://localhost:3000/health > /dev/null 2>&1; then
  echo "✅ Backend health check passed"
else
  echo "⚠️  Backend is running but health check failed (might be normal if no /health endpoint)"
fi
```

### 2.2 前端服务启动

**步骤**：
1. 检查并终止旧进程（端口 5173）
2. 启动前端服务
3. 验证启动状态
4. 检查日志输出

**实现**：
```bash
# 1. 终止旧进程
echo "Step 1: Cleaning up old frontend process..."
if lsof -ti :5173 > /dev/null 2>&1; then
  kill -9 $(lsof -ti :5173) 2>/dev/null
  sleep 2
fi

# 2. 启动前端服务（后台运行）
echo "Step 2: Starting frontend service..."
cd client && npm run dev > /tmp/myagent-frontend.log 2>&1 &
FRONTEND_PID=$!

# 3. 等待服务启动
echo "Step 3: Waiting for frontend to start..."
sleep 10

# 4. 验证服务状态
echo "Step 4: Verifying frontend status..."
if lsof -ti :5173 > /dev/null 2>&1; then
  echo "✅ Frontend started successfully on port 5173"
  echo "Frontend PID: $(lsof -ti :5173)"
else
  echo "❌ Frontend failed to start"
  echo "Frontend logs:"
  tail -50 /tmp/myagent-frontend.log
  exit 1
fi

# 5. 检查首页
echo "Step 5: Checking frontend homepage..."
sleep 2
if curl -s http://localhost:5173 > /dev/null 2>&1; then
  echo "✅ Frontend is accessible"
else
  echo "⚠️  Frontend is running but not accessible yet"
fi
```

### 2.3 完整服务重启流程

```bash
#!/bin/bash
# restart-all-services.sh

echo "========================================="
echo "MyAgent Service Restart Script"
echo "========================================="

# ===== 1. 清理旧进程 =====
echo ""
echo "[1/6] Cleaning up old processes..."

# 终止后端
if lsof -ti :3000 > /dev/null 2>&1; then
  echo "  Terminating backend (port 3000)..."
  kill -9 $(lsof -ti :3000) 2>/dev/null
fi

# 终止前端
if lsof -ti :5173 > /dev/null 2>&1; then
  echo "  Terminating frontend (port 5173)..."
  kill -9 $(lsof -ti :5173) 2>/dev/null
fi

sleep 3
echo "  ✅ Cleanup complete"

# ===== 2. 启动后端 =====
echo ""
echo "[2/6] Starting backend service..."
npm run dev > /tmp/myagent-backend.log 2>&1 &
BACKEND_PID=$!
echo "  Backend PID: $BACKEND_PID"

# ===== 3. 等待后端启动 =====
echo ""
echo "[3/6] Waiting for backend to be ready..."
for i in {1..30}; do
  if curl -s http://localhost:3000 > /dev/null 2>&1; then
    echo "  ✅ Backend is ready after ${i}s"
    break
  fi
  if [ $i -eq 30 ]; then
    echo "  ❌ Backend failed to start within 30s"
    echo "  Backend logs:"
    tail -50 /tmp/myagent-backend.log
    exit 1
  fi
  sleep 1
  echo "  Waiting... ($i/30)"
done

# ===== 4. 启动前端（可选）=====
echo ""
echo "[4/6] Starting frontend service..."
if [ -d "client" ]; then
  cd client && npm run dev > /tmp/myagent-frontend.log 2>&1 &
  FRONTEND_PID=$!
  cd ..
  echo "  Frontend PID: $FRONTEND_PID"
else
  echo "  ⚠️  No frontend directory found, skipping frontend"
fi

# ===== 5. 验证服务状态 =====
echo ""
echo "[5/6] Verifying services..."

# 验证后端
if lsof -ti :3000 > /dev/null 2>&1; then
  echo "  ✅ Backend running on port 3000 (PID: $(lsof -ti :3000))"
else
  echo "  ❌ Backend not running"
  exit 1
fi

# 验证前端
if lsof -ti :5173 > /dev/null 2>&1; then
  echo "  ✅ Frontend running on port 5173 (PID: $(lsof -ti :5173))"
else
  echo "  ⚠️  Frontend not running (optional)"
fi

# ===== 6. 显示服务信息 =====
echo ""
echo "[6/6] Service Information"
echo "========================================="
echo "Backend URL:  http://localhost:3000"
echo "Frontend URL: http://localhost:5173"
echo ""
echo "Backend Logs:  /tmp/myagent-backend.log"
echo "Frontend Logs: /tmp/myagent-frontend.log"
echo ""
echo "To view logs:"
echo "  tail -f /tmp/myagent-backend.log"
echo "  tail -f /tmp/myagent-frontend.log"
echo "========================================="
```

## 3. 自动化测试流程

### 3.1 测试前准备

**每次测试前必须执行**：
1. 保存当前代码更改
2. 重新编译 TypeScript（如果需要）
3. 重启相关服务
4. 等待服务完全启动
5. 验证服务健康状态

**实现**：
```bash
#!/bin/bash
# prepare-and-test.sh

echo "Preparing for automated testing..."

# 1. 编译 TypeScript
echo "[1/4] Compiling TypeScript..."
npm run build:ts
if [ $? -ne 0 ]; then
  echo "❌ TypeScript compilation failed"
  exit 1
fi
echo "✅ TypeScript compiled successfully"

# 2. 重启服务
echo "[2/4] Restarting services..."
bash restart-all-services.sh
if [ $? -ne 0 ]; then
  echo "❌ Service restart failed"
  exit 1
fi
echo "✅ Services restarted successfully"

# 3. 等待服务稳定
echo "[3/4] Waiting for services to stabilize..."
sleep 5
echo "✅ Services are stable"

# 4. 运行测试
echo "[4/4] Running automated tests..."
# 测试逻辑在下面
```

### 3.2 真实 HTTP 请求测试

**使用 curl 进行真实 API 调用**：

```bash
#!/bin/bash
# test-api-endpoint.sh

API_URL="http://localhost:3000"

echo "Testing API endpoint: $API_URL"

# 测试 1: 健康检查
echo ""
echo "Test 1: Health Check"
response=$(curl -s -w "\n%{http_code}" "$API_URL/health")
http_code=$(echo "$response" | tail -n1)
body=$(echo "$response" | sed '$d')

if [ "$http_code" -eq 200 ]; then
  echo "✅ Health check passed"
  echo "Response: $body"
else
  echo "❌ Health check failed (HTTP $http_code)"
  echo "Response: $body"
  exit 1
fi

# 测试 2: 提交任务
echo ""
echo "Test 2: Submit Task"
task_response=$(curl -s -w "\n%{http_code}" -X POST \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"task": "test task", "sessionId": "test-session"}' \
  "$API_URL/agent/execute")

task_http_code=$(echo "$task_response" | tail -n1)
task_body=$(echo "$task_response" | sed '$d')

if [ "$task_http_code" -eq 200 ]; then
  echo "✅ Task submitted successfully"
  echo "Response: $task_body"
else
  echo "❌ Task submission failed (HTTP $task_http_code)"
  echo "Response: $task_body"
  exit 1
fi

# 提取 taskId
task_id=$(echo "$task_body" | jq -r '.taskId // .id // empty')

if [ -z "$task_id" ]; then
  echo "⚠️  Could not extract taskId from response"
else
  echo "Task ID: $task_id"

  # 测试 3: 查询任务状态
  echo ""
  echo "Test 3: Get Task Status"
  status_response=$(curl -s -w "\n%{http_code}" "$API_URL/agent/tasks/$task_id")
  status_http_code=$(echo "$status_response" | tail -n1)
  status_body=$(echo "$status_response" | sed '$d')

  if [ "$status_http_code" -eq 200 ]; then
    echo "✅ Task status retrieved"
    echo "Response: $status_body"
  else
    echo "❌ Failed to get task status (HTTP $status_http_code)"
    echo "Response: $status_body"
  fi
fi

echo ""
echo "========================================="
echo "All API tests passed! ✅"
echo "========================================="
```

### 3.3 使用 Node.js 进行复杂测试

**对于复杂场景，使用 Node.js 脚本**：

```javascript
// test-api-complex.js
import http from 'http';

const API_URL = 'http://localhost:3000';

function request(method, path, data = null) {
  return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {
    const url = new URL(path, API_URL);
    const options = {
      method,
      headers: {
        'Content-Type': 'application/json',
      },
    };

    const req = http.request(url, options, (res) => {
      let body = '';
      res.on('data', (chunk) => body += chunk);
      res.on('end', () => {
        resolve({
          statusCode: res.statusCode,
          headers: res.headers,
          body: body ? JSON.parse(body) : null,
        });
      });
    });

    req.on('error', reject);

    if (data) {
      req.write(JSON.stringify(data));
    }

    req.end();
  });
}

async function runTests() {
  console.log('Running complex API tests...\n');

  try {
    // Test 1: Create session
    console.log('Test 1: Create session');
    const sessionResult = await request('POST', '/api/sessions', {
      userId: 'test-user',
    });
    console.log(`Status: ${sessionResult.statusCode}`);
    console.log(`Response:`, sessionResult.body);
    console.log('✅ Session created\n');

    const sessionId = sessionResult.body.sessionId;

    // Test 2: Execute task
    console.log('Test 2: Execute task');
    const taskResult = await request('POST', '/agent/execute', {
      task: 'Analyze this code',
      sessionId,
      availableSkills: ['code-analysis'],
    });
    console.log(`Status: ${taskResult.statusCode}`);
    console.log(`Response:`, taskResult.body);
    console.log('✅ Task submitted\n');

    const taskId = taskResult.body.taskId;

    // Test 3: Poll for result
    console.log('Test 3: Poll for task completion');
    let completed = false;
    let attempts = 0;
    const maxAttempts = 30;

    while (!completed && attempts < maxAttempts) {
      await new Promise(resolve => setTimeout(resolve, 2000));

      const statusResult = await request('GET', `/agent/tasks/${taskId}`);
      console.log(`Attempt ${attempts + 1}: ${statusResult.body.status}`);

      if (statusResult.body.status === 'completed' || statusResult.body.status === 'failed') {
        completed = true;
        console.log(`Final status: ${statusResult.body.status}`);
        console.log(`Result:`, statusResult.body.output || statusResult.body.error);
        console.log('✅ Task completed\n');
      }

      attempts++;
    }

    if (!completed) {
      throw new Error('Task did not complete within timeout');
    }

    console.log('=========================================');
    console.log('All tests passed! ✅');
    console.log('=========================================');

  } catch (error) {
    console.error('❌ Test failed:', error.message);
    console.error('Stack:', error.stack);
    process.exit(1);
  }
}

runTests();
```

